# Corpus root.
#
# Wave 1 target: 50 fixtures by end of wave (master plan §15.1).
# Each fixture is a directory:
#   <id>/
#     workspace/         snapshot of a real codebase state
#     request.txt        the user's prompt
#     golden_patch.diff  known-correct fix
#     golden_tests/      tests that pass on golden, fail on workspace
#     metadata.json      { difficulty, language, intent, has_dep_change, ... }
#
# Coverage targets: Python, TS/JS, multi-file, dep-change, refactor,
# performance, type-error, logic bug.
